[Desktop Entry]
Name=NethLink
Exec=nethlink %U
Terminal=false
Type=Application
Icon=nethlink
StartupWMClass=NethLink
Comment=NethLink is a tool designed to link NethServer systems and provide remote access tools. This project aims to offer a simple yet powerful user interface for managing NethServer systems more efficiently.
MimeType=x-scheme-handler/tel;x-scheme-handler/callto;x-scheme-handler/nethlink;
Categories=Utility;
